From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: domicile CI <ci@domicile.invalid>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: an <app> can say it is being resized

Names the `resizing` attribute, which html_app_element.idl reflects.
While it is set, an <app> embeds each new box with deadline 0 instead
of holding the page's frame for its client. See
third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/domicile/html_app_element.cc.
---
 third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_attribute_names.json5 | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_attribute_names.json5 b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_attribute_names.json5
index cd3fa157..06a6e231 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_attribute_names.json5
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_attribute_names.json5
@@ -343,6 +343,7 @@
     "referrerpolicy",
     "rel",
     "required",
+    "resizing",
     "rev",
     "reversed",
     "role",
